Dialogue: 9,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,23:35 - Episódio Final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,Mais um ano chega ao fim
Dialogue: 9,0:00:04.39,0:00:06.26,Top,,0,0,0,,Preste atenção, Dera.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:06.26,0:00:10.49,Top,,0,0,0,,Minhas profecias dizem que a noiva do príncipe está localizada bem ao noroeste daqui.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:10.49,0:00:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Noroeste?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:12.52,0:00:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Entre em contato comigo todo dia e me diga onde você está. Eu direi aonde ir a partir daí.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendido, Choi-sama.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:20.95,0:00:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.48,0:00:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Príncipe!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:23.04,0:00:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,E aí, príncipe. Já terminou de cochilar?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.88,0:00:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:26.46,0:00:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é, Dera...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:29.33,0:00:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai mesmo partir?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:31.17,0:00:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu príncipe, logo você terá que assumir o trono.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:34.24,0:00:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Você precisa encontrar sua noiva antes disso.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:37.83,0:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso faz parte dos nossos costumes...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:39.94,0:00:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,E devemos seguir nossos costumes.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.48,0:00:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas estou preocupada com Dera indo tão longe.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:46.62,0:00:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera, se cuida por aí.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:49.47,0:00:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se esforce demais.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:51.23,0:00:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei. Não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:53.74,0:00:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera! Como você ousa usar esse tom com o príncipe!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:58.12,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, Choi.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:59.84,0:01:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera é meu amigo desde a infância.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:04.47,0:01:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera, se cuide.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:07.79,0:01:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Não viaje quando o tempo estiver ruim.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:10.69,0:01:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ficar perigoso, volte imediatamente. Além disso—
Dialogue: 9,0:01:13.78,0:01:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Para de implicar.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:17.59,0:01:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa se preocupar, meu príncipe.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei! Sai de cima dele!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:25.31,0:01:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera, chegou a hora.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:27.27,0:01:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito bem, então.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:28.44,0:01:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, Dera! É hora de você partir em sua jornada!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:31.36,0:01:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Esta flauta te mostrará o caminho!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:39.03,0:01:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:40.75,0:01:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Que as maiores bênçãos iluminem seu caminho!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:56.37,0:01:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou cansado...
Dialogue: 9,0:01:58.12,0:02:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,É a primeira vez que eu deixo a ilha...
Dialogue: 9,0:02:02.17,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse lugar tem cheiro do príncipe.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:05.24,0:02:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou descansar aqui um pouco.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:09.85,0:03:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{OP}
