Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.20,0:22:34.87,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k17}{\k30}{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}se{\k22}ka{\k46}i {\k44}ga {\k42}bo{\k46}ya{\k42}ke{\k77}te
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.20,0:22:34.87,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}O mundo ficou todo borrado
